.env*

# design-system-docs/uploads is scratch space for pasted chat material — it
# never ships (BRAND_SOURCES does not list it) and the brand manifest
# categorises anything under it origin: "incidental". Keep the directory
# itself so the manifest generator has somewhere to look.
design-system-docs/uploads/*
!design-system-docs/uploads/.gitkeep

# Playwright run output. Baselines under tests/visual/__screenshots__ are
# committed on purpose (issue #65) — these are per-run artifacts.
playwright-report/
test-results/
# The AI Elements accessibility sweep's per-run output: one JSONL row per
# component per dial combination. The audit that reads it is written up in
# docs/agents/ai-elements-accessibility.md; the raw rows are regenerated by
# `pnpm a11y:elements` and are not a baseline.
packages/ai-elements/a11y/results/
packages/ai-elements/a11y/a11y-results.json
blob-report/
# Where visual.yml's `full` job collects every shard's blob report before
# merging them into one; `merge-reports` also extracts them in place.
all-blob-reports/
# The Storybook and docs builds, packed once per run by visual.yml's `build`
# job and unpacked in every job that sweeps. It lands in the repo root of a
# checkout that also commits baselines from that same working tree.
build-outputs.tar.gz
